# Normalize every text file to LF in the repository and in checkouts. The
# packaged skill body and its frontmatter delimiters are parsed as `\n`, so a
# CRLF checkout (Windows default core.autocrlf=true) must not change them. The
# corridor card and the seam catalog are cross-checked line by line, so a mixed
# line-ending checkout would break the parity gate rather than the content.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.tgz binary
